Our name, Tolemi (tol-uh-mee), is a play on Ptolemy, the greek polymath most famously known for combining disparate maps to produce the first complete, accurate picture of the world. Our goal is to make smarter, more effective governments – vital institutions that protect and strengthen the communities and people they serve.
